      "authors": [
        "Lukas Babaliauskas"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand why evaluating AI agents requires inspecting tool calls and state changes rather than just text replies. You will gain a clear mental model and precise terminology for building effective agent evaluation pipelines.",
