        "Julia Kempe"
      ],
      "why_read": "Read this to understand how scaling compute within a simple verifier-feedback loop can match or exceed specialized, hand-crafted proof architectures. You will learn how tight environment interaction enables single-attempt reasoning to solve open formal mathematics problems.",
